-- +goose Up
-- DPA-01 (docs/decisions.md Q-32): a ready-to-use TH/EN standard DPA template under section 40 — PLT-16's
-- document composer already registers the "dpa" doc type (internal/wiring.Docs, agreement.dpa.* permissions,
-- read/create/update/publish all already seeded to LEGAL) and already has its own generic, doc-type-agnostic
-- template library (internal/platform/docs/library.go's ListTemplates/CreateTemplate/PublishTemplate on
-- platform.templates, the same table/mechanism PNG-03's wizard templates already used, just language='mul'
-- — one row carries both th/en content as render.Content's own {"th": ..., "en": ...} shape instead of
-- separate per-language rows). No new backend or frontend code: /documents/templates already lets anyone
-- holding agreement.dpa.update author/clone a "dpa" template, this just seeds the first, global
-- (tenant_id NULL) one so LEGAL has something ready to use/clone from day one, the same "seed a draft
-- flagged for legal review" move ORG-07/ROPA-09/PNG-03/DPIA-01/RTG-01/VEN-04 already made — the clause
-- wording here paraphrases ม.40(1)-(3)/37(2)/28-29 from this feature's own module-doc description, not an
-- official legal source.
ALTER TABLE platform.templates NO FORCE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;

